     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<b>Von:</b> National Centre for Statistical Ecology Members Mailing List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NC...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a>&gt; im Auftrag von Eleni Matechou &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">00014031ee1a45e...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Mittwoch, 25. November 2026 12:46<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NC...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NC...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> Funded PhD project - Cooperation and conflict under warming: How does temperature shape social behaviour in bees?</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nI would be grateful if you could forward this to your networks and to anyone who might be a good fit. Madeleine Ostwald (School of Biological and Behavioural Sciences) and I (School of Mathematical Sciences) are advertising a 3-year funded PhD studentship at\r\n Queen Mary University of London. The project will look at how temperature affects social tolerance, aggression and social living across bee species, from individual organisms up to the macroecological scale. It combines behavioural field experiments with large-scale\r\n ecological data, with a focus on advanced statistical approaches for modelling behaviour. The student will be trained in both behavioural and statistical ecology across our two groups.</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nWe are looking for candidates with, or expecting, a first or upper-second class honours degree and a Master&#39;s degree in biology, ecology, zoology or a related area. They should have an interest in animal behaviour, experience of ecological fieldwork, and a\r\n strong quantitative background that includes statistical analysis and programming in R or Python, along with motivation to develop advanced statistical modelling skills. The studentship covers home tuition fees and an annual tax-free stipend (£22,618 in 2026/27).\r\n It starts in September 2027, and the application deadline is 27 January 2027.</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nFull details and how to apply: <a href=\"https://www.findaphd.com/phds/project/cooperation-and-conflict-under-warming-how-does-temperature-shape-social-behaviour-in-bees/?p203261\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.findaphd.com/phds/project/cooperation-and-conflict-under-warming-how-does-temperature-shape-social-behaviour-in-bees/?p203261&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1795773780860000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cyhuQCOhNotEW8zocunQZ\">\r\nhttps://www.findaphd.com/phds/project/cooperation-and-conflict-under-warming-how-does-temperature-shape-social-behaviour-in-bees/?p203261</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nInformal enquiries to Madeleine Ostwald (<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">m.os...@qmul.ac.uk</a>).</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\"><b>Eleni Matechou</b> (she/her)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\">Reader in Statistics</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\">School of Mathematical Sciences</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\">Queen Mary University of London</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\">Email: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">e.mat...@qmul.ac.uk</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(36,36,36)\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\